(511, 'Amit Mehra', 'amit.mehra.9384@gmal.com', '0350 92037', 'INVITATION / EVENT REMINDER - Please register today\r\n\r\nWebinar: How to Establish a USA tax-free Company for Foreign, Non-resident Owners\r\n\r\nDate: Tuesday, 1st March 2022\r\n\r\nTime: Â 11am (UAE) / 12:30 (midday) (India) / 3pm (Singapore / HK / China / Ph)\r\n\r\nFormat: Online live event\r\n\r\nRegistration and Attendee Link: https://www.runtheworld.today/app/invitation/40459\r\n\r\nThe worldâ€™s workforce shiftedâ€¯to aâ€¯remoteâ€¯settingâ€¯practically overnight,â€¯andâ€¯companies reexaminedâ€¯how well they functioned.  In new research conducted by Forrester Consulting shows thatâ€¯the Covid19 pandemic createdâ€¯an opportunityâ€¯for organizations to create a competitive differentiator; one of which is to look at where they are legally established in order to access the most preferrential investor, grants, government, jurisdictional and tax treatment.\r\n\r\nIn this webinar you will learn about:\r\n1. The different types of companies available to foreign, non-resident, owners\r\n2. How certain types of foreign-owned companies can quality for tax-free status in the USA\r\n3. The steps required to form a US company without visiting the USA\r\n4. How to open a US business bank account remotely\r\n5. How to access US government grants\r\n6. How to win US government contracts / tenders\r\n7. Types of visas available for foreign owners and managers of US companies\r\n8. Annual filing requirements\r\n\r\nThis event will be presented by the Trade Council\r\n\r\nOPT OUT: If you do not wish to be contacted in the future please opt-out here: https://bit.ly/3HY2cSz\r\n', '27-02-2022');
